  "details": "hi there. my name is emma. and i have played VRChat for about 4000 hours at this point. and in the past year ish. i have been enjoying this game more and more. thanks to one specific mod. Closed Caption Mod. this increased my social interactions MASSIVELY. because... im deaf.\ni suddenly was able to get in contact with so much more people who have not had the chance to learn ASL. them talking. me being able to read what they say. and being able to respond. has changed my ways of being social with people.\nand... this safety update. pretty much ruined about 90% of my interactions with people. because i cant understand them anymore.\nthe Closed Caption Mod. even allowed me to filter out toxic people who were just bullying me in VRC for being deaf. i could see it. and block and report them.\ni. and alot of other people. need their mod access back. OR someone who will listen to the community. BEFORE ruining the game for TONS of people.\ni hope... i TRULY hope... this reaches you...\nbecause. first of all. this is ruining alot of peoples social life...\nand second. you got multiple people on the verge of crying here while typing this.\nto me. this is a VERY dark time for VRChat",
